        "description": "Severe feeding difficulties requiring intervention",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of pontocerebellar hypoplasia on neuroimaging plus biallelic TSEN54 mutations with early-onset neurodegeneration",
    "notes": "Genetic confirmation is critical due to phenotypic overlap with other pontocerebellar hypoplasias."
